  "description": "Arcturus.Patchable is a lightweight .NET library for modeling and applying partial updates (patches) to objects in Web APIs. It provides strongly-typed patch contracts, opt-in patchable members, and helpers to validate, map, and merge changes before persistence—ideal for JSON-driven APIs where clients send only the fields they want to change.",
